  "body_html": "<p>Add a personal touch to the bedroom with this custom-designed basketball bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring a vibrant sports print, this comforter is a perfect personalized gift for basketball players, fans, and sports enthusiasts of all ages.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own Name and Number for a truly unique and personal sports bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric for a soft, comfortable, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Stitching:</strong> Features a whole-piece microfiber filling with tight, smooth, and compact stitching to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Fully machine washable in cold water, quick-drying, and designed to hold onto dye to prevent fading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Options:</strong> Available as a Duvet Cover or Comforter Set in multiple sizes including Twin, Full, Queen, and King.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Basketball D12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Customized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name &amp; Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
